      <method name="activate_action_variant" c:identifier="gtk_widget_activate_action_variant" shadows="activate_action">
        <doc xml:space="preserve" filename="gtk/gtkwidget.c" line="11896">
          Activates an action for the widget.

The action is looked up in the action groups associated with
@widget and its ancestors.

If the action is in an action group added with
[method@Gtk.Widget.insert_action_group], the @name is expected
to be prefixed with the prefix that was used when the group was
inserted.

The arguments must match the actions expected parameter type,
as returned by [method@Gio.Action.get_parameter_type].
        </doc>
        <return-value transfer-ownership="none">
          <type name="gboolean" c:type="gboolean"/>
        </return-value>
